/*
  Component:  ISO 4032 - M5
  Standard:   ISO 4032:2023
  Family:     hexagon regular nut
  Size:       M5
  Data source: ISO 4032:2023 hexagon regular nut table; nominal values, see components/DATA_SOURCES.md
  Notes:      Hexagon regular nut with a through bore. Both bearing faces carry a 45-degree chamfer (engineering default, not a standard dimension). A swept helical thread ridge is modeled.
  Features modeled:      hex-body, nut-face-chamfer, helical-thread
  Features approximated: through-bore (PolylineArc, deviation 0.0030113594870689875 mm, control circle_segments=64); helical-ridge (SweptSpline, deviation 0.019165156350520733 mm, control segments_per_turn=24)
  Features omitted:      bore-edge-chamfer (not modelled by this builder); thread-runout (not modelled by this builder); thread-runout (the swept ridge ends at the shank ends; thread runout and lead-in are not modelled)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
